  "minimal_integration_gaps": [
    "Define and version CS88 transport/profile negotiation; MSV1 codec byte 1 remains JPEG and must not be silently repurposed.",
    "Implement selected native CS88 encoder and packetizer in isolated Sunshine, shared by live and deterministic paths; pin output fixtures and host service assumptions.",
    "Add negotiated bounded CS88 receive/recovery path in ESP32 firmware, including frame identity/CRC/cap/credit and a defined QSPI transaction mapping.",
